            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 4\" x 24\" Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Push Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nExtra long solid bronze push plate.  4\" wide x 24\" high door push plate. Push plates are made of .050\" thick, high quality solid bronze with oil rubbed bronze finish. Packaged with mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/8-x-16-polished-brass-push-plate\"><b>8\" x 16\" Brass Push Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/8-x-16-stainless-steel-push-plate\"><b>8\" x 16\" Stainless Steel Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese extra long push plates are made in the USA by Don-Jo Mfg.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Don-Jo PP-4x24-613 Oil Rubbed Bronze Push Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
